# NOTE: app/public/{cards,teams,elo}.json are generated by the Python pipeline but ARE
# committed — Netlify only runs the JS build (npm run build), not the pipeline, so the app
# would ship with no player data if these were ignored. Rebuild them with the pipeline locally.

